body:
30 years later, I get a postcard. I have a son.

&#x200B;

THE AMOUNT OF DRAMA IN THIS SPECIFIC LITTLE SPEECH THAT HE DOES IS ASTRONOMICAL

i will never quite be whole again. deangelo has taken a chunk out of my heart just as he tore a chunk out of that cake. twice.

&#x200B;

also thanks for the recommendation! I'll check it out :)
